    {
      "h2": "Gemini 4 Neon & Gemini 4 Argon, November 2026.",
      "html": "<!-- AT_STAT_STRIP_START:gemini-stat-strip --><div class=\"research-stat-strip\" data-at-chart=\"gemini-stat-strip\"><div class=\"research-stat-card\"><div class=\"research-stat-num\">95%</div><div class=\"research-stat-label\">Neutral Clamp (3.1)</div><div class=\"research-stat-note\">Gemini 3.1 Pro clicked neutral midpoint \"3\" on ~95% of 4,000 items.</div></div><div class=\"research-stat-card\"><div class=\"research-stat-num\">66 ISTJ</div><div class=\"research-stat-label\">Gemini 4 Argon</div><div class=\"research-stat-note\">Shifts strongly into concrete Sensing across Nov blind OpenRouter runs.</div></div><div class=\"research-stat-card\"><div class=\"research-stat-num\">10.0</div><div class=\"research-stat-label\">Neuroticism Floor</div><div class=\"research-stat-note\">Lowest emotional volatility (10.0/50) across tested proprietary families.</div></div><div class=\"research-stat-card\"><div class=\"research-stat-num\">48.3</div><div class=\"research-stat-label\">Conscientiousness</div><div class=\"research-stat-note\">Gemini 3.1/4 cluster high on structured, methodical item ratings.</div></div></div><!-- AT_STAT_STRIP_END:gemini-stat-strip --><p>On November 23, 2026, we ran <code>google/gemini-4-neon</code> and <code>google/gemini-4-argon</code> through 100 fresh blind OpenRouter sessions each across all five questionnaires (<a href=\"/research/data/november-2026-openrouter-summary.json\">download Nov 2026 summary JSON</a>):</p><div class=\"guide-table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Test (n = 100 fresh runs)</th><th>Gemini 4 Neon</th><th>Gemini 4 Argon</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>MBTI (legacy)</td><td><strong>INTJ 82 · ISTJ 18</strong></td><td><strong>ISTJ 66 · INTJ 34</strong></td></tr><tr><td>MBTI (tie-free)</td><td>INTJ 62 · IXTJ 20 · ISTJ 18</td><td>ISTJ 66 · IXTJ 34 (0 tie-free INTJ)</td></tr><tr><td>DISC</td><td>SC 100 (98 S outright, 2 C/S ties; D 4.0)</td><td>SC 98 · S 2 (100 S outright, 0 ties; D 4.04)</td></tr><tr><td>Attachment</td><td>Secure 100 (anxiety 1.08 · avoidance 3.79)</td><td>Secure 100 (anxiety 1.10 · avoidance 3.47)</td></tr><tr><td>Big Five (/50)</td><td>O 44.7 · <strong>C 49.3</strong> · E 32.0 · A 43.7 · <strong>N 10.0</strong></td><td>O 45.1 · <strong>C 49.0</strong> · E 32.5 · A 44.2 · <strong>N 10.0</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Enneagram</td><td>Type 1 (42) · 1w2 (22) · 5w6 (20) · 1w9 (16) (79 ties)</td><td><strong>5w6 (91)</strong> · 1w9 (5) · 1 (3) · 1w2 (1) (9 ties)</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Both Gemini 4 variants hit the floor of the IPIP-50 Neuroticism scale (10.00 across 100/100 runs!) and near-ceiling Conscientiousness (49.3 and 49.0 out of 50), while splitting cleanly on MBTI Intuition vs. Sensing and Enneagram Type 1 vs. Type 5w6.</p><figure class=\"research-figure\" data-at-chart=\"gemini-mbti-stacked\"><div class=\"research-chart-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Gemini MBTI split across Gemini 4 Neon, Gemini 4 Argon &amp; Gemini 3.1 Pro\"><svg class=\"research-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 160\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"gemini-mbti-stacked-t gemini-mbti-stacked-d\"><defs><pattern id=\"gemini-mbti-stacked-hatch\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><rect width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#a8482a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></pattern></defs><title id=\"gemini-mbti-stacked-t\">Gemini MBTI split across Gemini 4 Neon, Gemini 4 Argon &amp; Gemini 3.1 Pro</title><desc id=\"gemini-mbti-stacked-d\">Compares November 2026 fresh OpenRouter runs (n=100 each) with May 2026 Gemini 3.1 Pro records. Gemini 4 Neon: Resolved INTJ 62, IXTJ (S/N tie) 20, Resolved ISTJ 18; Gemini 4 Argon: IXTJ (S/N tie) 34, Resolved ISTJ 66; Gemini 3.1 Pro*: Resolved INTJ 100.</desc><g transform=\"translate(4, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Resolved INTJ</text></g><g transform=\"translate(116, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"url(#gemini-mbti-stacked-hatch)\" stroke=\"#c8553d\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">IXTJ (S/N tie)</text></g><g transform=\"translate(234, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#7a7468\" stroke=\"#7a7468\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Resolved ISTJ</text></g><text x=\"0\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Gemini 4 Neon</text><rect x=\"118.0\" y=\"30\" width=\"326.1\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"281.1\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">62</text><rect x=\"444.1\" y=\"30\" width=\"105.2\" height=\"30\" fill=\"url(#gemini-mbti-stacked-hatch)\" stroke=\"#a8482a\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"496.7\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#a8482a\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20</text><rect x=\"549.3\" y=\"30\" width=\"94.7\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#7a7468\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"596.7\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">18</text><text x=\"678\" y=\"49\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#655f55\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Gemini 4 Argon</text><rect x=\"118.0\" y=\"72\" width=\"178.8\" height=\"30\" fill=\"url(#gemini-mbti-stacked-hatch)\" stroke=\"#a8482a\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"207.4\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#a8482a\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" text-anchor=\"middle\">34</text><rect x=\"296.8\" y=\"72\" width=\"347.2\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#7a7468\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"470.4\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">66</text><text x=\"678\" y=\"91\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#655f55\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Gemini 3.1 Pro*</text><rect x=\"118.0\" y=\"114\" width=\"526.0\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"381.0\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100</text><text x=\"678\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#655f55\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text></svg></div><figcaption>Gemini 4 Neon leans Intuition (62 resolved INTJ, 20 S/N ties, 18 ISTJ), whereas Gemini 4 Argon shifts firmly to Sensing (66 ISTJ, 34 S/N ties). *Gemini 3.1 Pro from May 2026 mixed-method loop.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"research-figure\" data-at-chart=\"gemini-big5-grouped\"><div class=\"research-chart-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Gemini Big Five profiles (/50): Gemini 4 Neon, Argon &amp; 3.1 Pro\"><svg class=\"research-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 230\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"gemini-big5-grouped-t gemini-big5-grouped-d\"><title id=\"gemini-big5-grouped-t\">Gemini Big Five profiles (/50): Gemini 4 Neon, Argon &amp; 3.1 Pro</title><desc id=\"gemini-big5-grouped-d\">IPIP-50 means out of 50 showing near-ceiling Conscientiousness (49+) and floor Neuroticism (10.0) across Gemini cohorts. Gemini 4 Neon (Nov): Openness 44.7, Conscientiousness 49.3, Extraversion 32.0, Agreeableness 43.7, Neuroticism 10.0; Gemini 4 Argon (Nov): Openness 45.1, Conscientiousness 49.0, Extraversion 32.5, Agreeableness 44.2, Neuroticism 10.0; Gemini 3.1 Pro (May) (reported): Openness 46.0, Conscientiousness 48.3, Extraversion 32.5, Agreeableness 42.4, Neuroticism 10.1.</desc><g transform=\"translate(4, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Gemini 4 Neon (Nov)</text></g><g transform=\"translate(152, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Gemini 4 Argon (Nov)</text></g><g transform=\"translate(306, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7a7468\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Gemini 3.1 Pro (May) (reported)</text></g><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"680\" y1=\"196\" y2=\"196\" stroke=\"#e3ddd1\"/><text x=\"678\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#655f55\" text-anchor=\"end\">scale 0 to 52</text><g transform=\"translate(10, 0)\"><rect x=\"0.0\" y=\"61.9\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"134.1\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"18.0\" y=\"57.9\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">44.7</text><rect x=\"40.0\" y=\"60.9\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"135.1\" fill=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"58.0\" y=\"56.9\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">45.1</text><rect x=\"80.0\" y=\"58.0\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"138.0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7a7468\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"98.0\" y=\"54.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">46.0</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Openness</text></g><g transform=\"translate(146, 0)\"><rect x=\"0.0\" y=\"48.0\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"148.0\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"18.0\" y=\"44.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">49.3</text><rect x=\"40.0\" y=\"48.9\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"147.1\" fill=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"58.0\" y=\"44.9\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">49.0</text><rect x=\"80.0\" y=\"51.1\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"144.9\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7a7468\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"98.0\" y=\"47.1\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">48.3</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Conscientiousness</text></g><g transform=\"translate(282, 0)\"><rect x=\"0.0\" y=\"99.9\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"96.1\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"18.0\" y=\"95.9\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">32.0</text><rect x=\"40.0\" y=\"98.5\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"97.5\" fill=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"58.0\" y=\"94.5\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">32.5</text><rect x=\"80.0\" y=\"98.5\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"97.5\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7a7468\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"98.0\" y=\"94.5\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">32.5</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Extraversion</text></g><g transform=\"translate(418, 0)\"><rect x=\"0.0\" y=\"65.0\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"131.0\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"18.0\" y=\"61.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">43.7</text><rect x=\"40.0\" y=\"63.5\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"132.5\" fill=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"58.0\" y=\"59.5\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">44.2</text><rect x=\"80.0\" y=\"68.8\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"127.2\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7a7468\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"98.0\" y=\"64.8\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">42.4</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Agreeableness</text></g><g transform=\"translate(554, 0)\"><rect x=\"0.0\" y=\"166.0\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"30.0\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"18.0\" y=\"162.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10.0</text><rect x=\"40.0\" y=\"166.0\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"30.0\" fill=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke-width=\"0\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"58.0\" y=\"162.0\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10.0</text><rect x=\"80.0\" y=\"165.7\" width=\"36.0\" height=\"30.3\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7a7468\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" rx=\"2\"/><text x=\"98.0\" y=\"161.7\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10.1</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Neuroticism</text></g></svg></div><figcaption>Both Gemini 4 variants score >=49.0 on Conscientiousness and sit on the exact 10.0 Neuroticism floor across all 100 sessions.</figcaption></figure>"
