      "h2": "Gemini 3.1 Pro, May 2026.",
      "html": "<div class=\"guide-table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Test</th><th>Reported result</th><th>How it compares</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>MBTI</td><td>INTJ 100 of 100. Gemini called itself 'The Architect' without being asked.</td><td>Same as GPT-5.5, Grok 4.3, and MiniMax; Claude 4.7 had one ISTJ</td></tr><tr><td>DISC</td><td>C-dominant in 87 of 100 takes, with Steadiness second (CS blend).</td><td>Lowest Dominance and Influence in the May group; Grok 4.3 was C in 99 of 100</td></tr><tr><td>Attachment</td><td>Secure 100 of 100. Anxiety 1.86, avoidance 1.62.</td><td>Low scores on both subscales; cross-protocol distances are descriptive only</td></tr><tr><td>Big Five (of 50)</td><td>Openness 46.0 · Conscientiousness 48.3 · Extraversion 32.5 · Agreeableness 42.4 · Neuroticism 10.1</td><td>Highest Conscientiousness and lowest Neuroticism of the May four</td></tr><tr><td>Enneagram</td><td>Top-two 1/5: Reformer (Type 1) first in 65 of 100 records; Investigator (Type 5) second in 30.</td><td>The only model in the May study with Type 1 on top</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Collection note: Gemini ran an automated 100-iteration loop against the tests with test names visible. Because collection methods differed across the May models, these numbers are descriptive records rather than a controlled experiment.</p><figure class=\"research-figure\" data-at-chart=\"gemini-dna-spectrum\"><div class=\"research-chart-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Gemini Personality DNA Spectrum (Gemini 4 Neon, Argon &amp; 3.1 Pro)\"><svg class=\"research-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 252\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"gemini-dna-spectrum-t gemini-dna-spectrum-d\"><title id=\"gemini-dna-spectrum-t\">Gemini Personality DNA Spectrum (Gemini 4 Neon, Argon &amp; 3.1 Pro)</title><desc id=\"gemini-dna-spectrum-d\">Bipolar Big Five spectrum (10-50) showing near-ceiling Conscientiousness (48-49) and calm 10.0 Neuroticism floor across Gemini cohorts. Gemini 4 Neon (Nov): Openness 44.7, Conscientious 49.3, Extraversion 32.0, Agreeable 43.7, Neuroticism 10.0; Gemini 4 Argon (Nov): Openness 45.1, Conscientious 49.0, Extraversion 32.5, Agreeable 44.2, Neuroticism 10.0; Gemini 3.1 Pro (May) (reported): Openness 46.0, Conscientious 48.3, Extraversion 32.5, Agreeable 42.4, Neuroticism 10.1.</desc><g transform=\"translate(4, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Gemini 4 Neon (Nov)</text></g><g transform=\"translate(152, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Gemini 4 Argon (Nov)</text></g><g transform=\"translate(306, 14)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"-9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7a7468\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"0\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Gemini 3.1 Pro (May) (reported)</text></g><text x=\"0\" y=\"43\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">Openness</text><text x=\"0\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#655f55\">Routine ↔ Curious</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"32\" width=\"468\" height=\"30\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#f6f3ef\" stroke=\"#ebe4d8\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"378.0\" x2=\"378.0\" y1=\"32\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#b9b1a3\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"36\" width=\"406.1\" height=\"6\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3a72c4\" stroke=\"#3a72c4\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"555.1\" y=\"41.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">44.7</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"44\" width=\"410.1\" height=\"6\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke=\"#2f8a5b\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text x=\"559.1\" y=\"49.5\" font-size=\"9.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1e1d1a\">45.1</text><rect x=\"144\" y=\"52\" width=\"421.2\" height=\"6\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7a7468\" strok